<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila sees peso settling at 26-27/dlr in last qtr.</title>
<headline>Manila sees peso settling at 26-27/dlr in last qtr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Tuesday its studies showed the peso would settle at between 27.00 and 28.00 to the dollar in the third quarter of this year and at between 26.00 and 27.00 in the last quarter.</p>
<p>The peso has closed at the 29.00 level since Monday, with the help of central bank intervention, after the bank last week allowed the currency to float within a wider range.</p>
</text>
